ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator using Gemini Models

1. Project Description

ComicCraft is an AI-powered application that uses Gemini models to generate creative comic story content from user-provided prompts.

2. Features

- User prompt input
- AI-based story generation
- Gemini model integration
- Simple user interface
- Generated story display

3. Technologies Used

- Python
- FastAPI
- Gemini Models
- HTML
- CSS
- Jinja2, if used in the project

4. Application Workflow

The user enters a story prompt through the interface. The FastAPI backend receives the request and communicates with the Gemini model. The generated response is then displayed to the user.

5. Project Files

app.py

Contains the main application logic and backend functionality.

requirements.txt

Contains the Python packages required to run the project.

templates/

Contains the HTML templates used by the application.

static/

Contains static resources such as CSS and other frontend files.

6. Development Process

The application was developed by creating the user interface, implementing backend functionality, integrating the Gemini model, and testing the generated output.

Conclusion

The development phase converts the project design into a functional ComicCraft application. The integration of FastAPI and Gemini models enables the application to process user prompts and generate AI-based comic story content.